62
00:08:21,927 --> 00:08:50,128
[Host] That's all for today. Sunshine Aquarium in Ikebukuro, Tokyo, is on a rooftop, so its penguins, sea lions, and pelicans live outdoors and can get heat stroke like people. With days over forty degrees this year, the aquarium started cooling them early — using shade, mist, cold water, and even ice — so its animals can get through the summer in good health. Thanks for listening, and see you tomorrow.

